{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_8_level_main_08-10_end",
  "groupId": "main_8",
  "stageId": "main_08-10",
  "title": "Reunited, Only to Separate",
  "storyCode": "R8-9",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-10_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a45d3ff17b2a07fc0c35ab165c467e9aade862040f924c403dce186411fb67c5",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Infected Fighter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_080",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You even defeated the reinforcements? I shouldn't have expected less from you, Talulah!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What about all the other Infected?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Infected Fighter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_080",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They all made it in one piece. The backup safehouse we found really came in great use."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Have you done a headcount yet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Infected Fighter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_080",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I did. Some of the kids were crying about how one of the older girls hasn't come back yet..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Infected Fighter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_080",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's sad, but this happens fairly often these days. *Sigh*."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shieldguard",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Talulah! We found the rest of the patrol unit. Looks like they've just been running away the whole time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Which way did they go?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shieldguard",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "East. Makes me wonder if they'll come across the folks we exiled."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shieldguard",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—Talulah?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Infected Fighter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_080",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "H-Hold on! Talulah, where are you going?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Running\nRunning.\nBoots soaked in freezing, chilling water.\nLegs sunk in white, blinding snow.\nForgot to use the sleigh.\nForgot to use the snowmobile.\nMelting all the snow.\nDashing in the mud.\nA long trail on the earth.\nA long trail in the snow.\nCold boring into the lungs.\nPain piercing into the brain.\nRunning.Running.\nAn endless snow.\nAn endless winter.\nAn endless world."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A drop.\nTalulah stopps in her tracks.\nAnother drop.\nTears drip down the corners of her eyes.\nShe does not notice the drops she shed."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Alina lies there on the ground.\nShe grips firmly onto the empty basket in her hand. Her clothes are dyed red with her own blood.\nThe grass and the mud around her body, once pale white, have been dyed a dark shade no less intense or florid.\nThe snow keeps falling, relentlessly."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No... A... A..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Talu...lah?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Alina...!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I didn't... want you to see me like this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't talk. Alina, stop talking... Just don't talk!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We need to stop the bleeding...! Just hang on...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm... not bleeding anymore... It's just..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "In that case... Let's go! We need to get you to the medics right away for a blood transfusion!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's okay... Don't worry... It's just... the things I traded for..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't worry about those... They aren't important... Let's head back... I'll take you there!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Draco carries the Elafia on her back. Only now does she notice: this little deer looks so delicate and light, but her weight is so, so unbearably heavy on her back... As heavy as the weight of this whole world."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_079#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Stop..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I won't!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Who did it... Who did it... Who did this to you?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Was it the Patrol Unit...?! The villagers?! Those bastards... Those bastards... I'll burn them all... I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wait, don't tell me... Was it the Infected we exiled...?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_078#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Those ungrateful shitheads... No, no... If the Shieldguards gave them any rations..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Talulah...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Alina... I'm listening... Just tell me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I won't tell you...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Why?! Why?! Are you not going to at least give me the chance to avenge you?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You mustn't... Don't you remember what you said to me yourself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You mustn't fight for revenge. You've already chosen, Talulah. You've already chosen a path to follow..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Giving up halfway... all because of me...? I won't have it..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't hold this against anybody... You mustn't."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What are you talking about?! What are you saying?! How can I not...? How am I supposed to not hold this against anyone?!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You told me yourself...! You said yourself that you can't harbor hatred against anyone... or you'd be... swallowed up... by that old man who placed that curse on you..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Even if those Arts never existed in the first place... Wouldn't you still... be taken over... by all those things that represented who he was?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You told me that yourself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Right... Right. But... But... Those people... Those..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...You know where they came from... and why they did that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You said it yourself... Those people... aren't our enemies..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Stop... Alina... Don't speak...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No... Talulah... Everything you said... I remember... so you must remember yourself..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "These aren't the people... you need to crush... It's Ursus... That drove them into that corner..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's Ursus... and... the world as it is..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's okay... That's enough, Alina... I get it now!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Talulah... There is one thing you can detest... Everything they did, you can scorn."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But... never hate... anyone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Do you agree with me...? Do you think what I said... is right? Are our lives... meaningful at all? Ugh... I don't know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm not sure what it was... that we did wrong... but I know very well just what that curse... is all about."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Your rage... can burn down the entire plain... but you mustn't hate..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Alina..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm worried. Talulah, I'm so worried. If I'm not here anymore, you must have Yelena remind you... All this..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Alina, stop! Don't go on! I don't... I don't want you gone. All of you need to be here with me. You, Yelena, Sasha, Eno... All of you..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I don't want to lose any of you...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Talulah... but all of us..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "All of us met... so that we could part one day."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The white-haired Draco keeps trudging on in the cold, endless snowfield. On her back, the Elafia girl trembles away, pausing only to take in deep breaths now and then.\nSnow drops down from the Elafia's horns. As Talulah slogs along, the snow-covered trees behind her begin to burn alight in silence. She has unknowingly begun to set her path ablaze.\nThe snowfields before her eyes are vast and endless. On her back, Alina is the only warmth she can feel.\nTalulah feels each and every beat of Alina's heart through her back, and they grow weaker and weaker by the moment.\nShe wants to scream. She wants to cry. She wants to squeeze everything she feels out of her lungs, as though it could erase all this from her body.\nBut Talulah stays silent the entire time."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Talulah..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We'll be there soon, Alina... We're almost there!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't close your eyes... Don't close your eyes!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's far..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You don't... need to lie."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The snowstorm is growing."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Talu...lah...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm listening, Alina. Tell me. What's the matter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Snow... is warmer... than I ever imagined."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm sorry... I still don't... have all the things we talked about... written down."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's okay. It's okay, Alina. It doesn't matter."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The children... Eno in particular... You need to..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm listening! Go on, Alina... I'm listening!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You need to... do more... than just talk to him..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's getting hot... Talulah..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...I don't want to die... I still haven't... your sister..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Talulah",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alina",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You must... live on..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "This will do it.\nTalulah will not remember what happens next.\nShe has no memories of anything after that.\nShe melted away each and every last thing she should have remembered, along with the snow.\nShe leaves behind only a trail of flames, and, with the exception of Alina, everything behind her is burned away in the inferno of her wake."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And Talulah treks on in the snow toward her parting with her dear friend."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_037#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Talulah! You're finally back! You didn't answer our calls, what—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_037#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...What... Who's that on your back...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_037#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She's not breathing! Medic! Get over here, now! Talulah, just hang on..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_037#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Talulah?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_037#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(What? She's walking right by... Where is she going?!)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shieldguard",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Talulah, you may be the leader here, but that doesn't make it any less serious to leave—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "Wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shieldguard",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yelena...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "Let her go."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shieldguard",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Do you know the poor little girl...?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "(Not really. I think... she's a teacher at the settlement.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shieldguard",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Oh, she's a teacher. Poor kids. That's another person they could look up to, gone.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shieldguard",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(But why is Talulah...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "(Everyone has secrets they want to keep to themselves..)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "(Whatever happened, it's hers alone to remember.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "With the Elafia still on her back, the Draco walks past the encampment. Their contours slowly begin to blur until they both disappear into the edge of the forest.\nNo one knows what happened after that.\nThey could only watch as the Draco walked into the darkness of the night."
    },
